==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-feeding frenzy.ogg|a=AU}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A wild, [[turbulent]] situation in which [[multiple]] [[shark]]s or other [[predatory]] fish attack one or more [[edible]] creatures [[simultaneously]], in [[competition]] with each other.
#: {{ux|en|When the terrified, bleeding cow was washed overboard into the river, the hungry piranhas entered a '''feeding frenzy''', turning the water red with blood.}}
# {{lb|en|idiomatic|by extension}} A [[voracious]] [[competition]] among would-be [[purchaser]]s, etc. for [[limited]] [[resources]].
#: {{ux|en|The manager hesitated to open the doors to the thronging holiday crowds, knowing that a '''feeding frenzy''' would soon ensue near the display of coveted toys.}}
# {{lb|en|informal}} An event in which participants erratically grab and eat food.
#: {{ux|en|Karen's new students thought treat day was a '''feeding frenzy''' and [[horde|horded]] the snack table.}}

